export anchor CondensedEfficientStyle:
    number: 205
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Condensed efficient
    idea: A tight operations console where condensed uppercase headings save width, 32px rows fit everything on one screen, and a slim icon rail keeps the canvas wide.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #f2f4f5, the canvas behind panels
        panel: #ffffff, panels, the rail, the top bar and fields
        header: #e7ebed, panel title bars and the table footer
        ink: #172026, text, the avatar tile and the chart baseline
        muted: #4f5b63, column heads, times and labels
        line: #d3d9dd, borders and row rules, never text
        teal: #0b6466, the primary button, links, the current rail item and this week bars
        tealTint: #e0eff0, the current rail item and a focused row
        haze: #a9bcc0, last week bars, never text
        green: #19663e, On track with a check
        amber: #855000, At risk with a diamond holding a bang
        red: #b0222a, Behind with a down triangle and the overdue alert
    type:
        Headings, labels, buttons, project names and KPI values use Roboto
        Condensed, Arial Narrow, Helvetica Neue Condensed, sans-serif with
        font-stretch condensed. Body text uses Roboto, Segoe UI, system-ui,
        Arial, sans-serif. KPI values are 22px condensed bold, the greeting
        18px condensed bold, project names 14px condensed bold, panel
        titles 13px condensed bold capitals tracked 0.06em, column heads
        and rail labels 11px condensed bold capitals, body 13px.
    layout:
        A 64px white icon rail on the left holds a teal B tile and six nav
        items, each an icon over an 11px caps label, the current one with a
        3px teal left edge and teal tint. A 48px top bar holds the caps
        breadcrumb Brightwork slash Home, the search field, the New project
        button, a bell with a red count of 4 and the user. Under it one
        white strip holds the greeting, the date, a red tinted overdue
        alert and, pushed right, the four KPIs inline as caps label then
        big value with hairline dividers. Below, a grid of the projects
        panel and a 340px right column. The projects panel is a zebra
        table with Project, Team, Progress bar and percent, Tasks, Due,
        Days left and Status, plus a totals footer. The right column
        stacks a compact two tone bar chart with a dashed divider between
        the weeks and three inline totals, then the activity log with a
        caps time column. Every panel has a grey 32px caps title bar.
        Below 1080px the right column moves under the table. Below 700px
        the rail becomes a top strip of icons, the KPIs a two by two
        grid, and the table scrolls inside its panel.
    spacing: A 4px unit. Gaps of 8 and 12px, 10px cell padding.
    density: High. 32px rows, 32px controls and a 48px top bar.
    corners: 2px on everything.
    borders: 1px cool grey around every panel, grey title bars and zebra rows.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        2px stroke outline icons at 16 to 18px. Status uses a square ended
        check for On track, a filled diamond with a white bang for At risk
        and a filled down triangle for Behind, always with the caps word.
    focus: A 2px teal outline offset 1px. Fields get a teal border and an inset teal ring. Rows get an inset teal outline and the teal tint.
    tone: Terse caps labels, such as Due this week, Days left and Latest 6.
